<topic id="GUID-7041174D-7922-49BD-A885-574D27488CF1" xml:lang="en-US"> 
  <title>Intel® Total Storage Encryption Reporting Structure</title> 
  <body> 
    <p> This section defines the Intel® Total Storage Encryption reporting structures that are published by the BIOS for OS consumption. The nested structures within the TSE reporting structures must be allocated as a contiguous memory block. 
    </p> 
    <p> There is only one instance of this TSE Description Table since there is only one TSE feature. 
    </p> 
